    16	ψ(x; q, a) = (1/φ(q)) Σ_{χ mod q} χ̄(a) · ψ(x, χ)
    17	ψ(x, χ)    = δ_χ x − Σ_{ρ_χ} x^{ρ_χ}/ρ_χ + (lower order)
    18	```
    19	
    20	with ρ_χ ranging over non-trivial zeros of L(s, χ) on the critical line
    21	(under GRH). The decoupled cost model:
    22	
    23	```
    24	T_total(q, a, x, K) =   T_zero_db_setup(q, K)        # χ-indexed zero cache
    25	                      + φ(q) · T_per_chi_eval(K, x)  # partial-sum eval
    26	                      + T_orthogonality(q)            # χ̄(a) Σ_χ sum
    27	```
